OL,3,GNEWSAJo Malone donates #100k for
OL,4,Acancer-detecting 'nose'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity says a #100,000 donation made
OL,7,Fby the perfume entrepreneur Jo Malone
OL,8,Fwill accelerate work on a
OL,9,Fcancer-detecting electronic nose.
OL,11,FMedical Detection Dogs (MDD), based in
OL,12,FMilton Keynes, has been working with
OL,13,Fthe quantum physicist Dr Andreas
OL,14,FMershin for more than 10 years to
OL,15,Fdevelop the SniffSpace device, modelled
OL,16,Fon the scent-detection abilities of
OL,17,Fdogs.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
