OL,3,GNEWSAJo Malone donates #100k for
OL,4,Acancer-detecting 'nose'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity said it would install a
OL,7,FSniffSpace in the coming months,
OL,8,Fallowing its dogs to sniff more samples
OL,9,Fin a secure room and generate more
OL,10,F"robust data".
OL,12,FChief executive Dr Claire Guest
OL,13,Fdescribed the funding as
OL,14,F"game-changing".
